{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30257","headline":"芙蓉溪送前资州裴使君归京宁拜户部裴侍郎 · 薛逢","name":"芙蓉溪送前资州裴使君归京宁拜户部裴侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桑柘林枯𪍷麦乾，欲分离袂百忧攒\n临溪莫话前途远，举酒须歌後会难。\n薄宦未甘霜髪改，夹衣犹耐水风寒。\n遥知阮巷归宁日，几院儿童候马看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}